<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - LVMH cut at Lehman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LVMH cut at Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French luxury goods group LVMH Moet Hennessey Louis Vuitton was cut to &quot;underperform&quot; from &quot;neutral&quot; at Lehman Brothers, a research note by analyst John Wakely at the brokerage said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Wakeley said recent gains in the stock had all the hallmarks of a bubble and that the stock's market valuation left no room for disappointment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
